      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P002_C01",
      "text": "notice implements a 27 per cent reservation for Other Backward Classes1 (non-creamy",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P003_C01",
      "text": "layer) and a 10 per cent reservation for the Economically Weaker Section,2 while filling",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 4,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P004_C01",
      "text": "up 15 per cent undergraduate and 50 per cent post-graduate3 All India Quota4 seats in",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 5,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P005_C01",
      "text": "pursuance of the National Eligibility cum Entrance Test5. The notice takes effect from",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 6,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P006_C01",
      "text": "the current admission year, 2021-2022. The petitioners are doctors who appeared in",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 7,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P007_C01",
      "text": "the NEET- PG 2021 examination.\n2 The petitions were instituted on 24 August 2021 to challenge the validity of the",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 8,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P008_C01",
      "text": "notice dated 29 July 2021. Notice was issued by this Court on 6 September 2021. The",
      "paragraph_type": "facts",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 9,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P009_C01",
      "text": "part on 7 October 2021. It was argued that there cannot be any reservation for the",
      "paragraph_type": "arguments",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 10,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P010_C01",
      "text": "determination of the EWS category notified by O.M 36039/1/20196 was unconstitutional.",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 11,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P011_C01",
      "text": "By an order dated 21 October 2021, this Court sought clarifications in regard to the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 12,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P012_C01",
      "text": "criteria provided by the OM of 2019 of using Rs 8 lakhs as the cut - off income limit for",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 13,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P013_C01",
      "text": "identifying EWS. Two weeks were granted to the Union Government to file an affidavit",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 14,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P014_C01",
      "text": "in this regard. When the batch was taken up for hearing on 21 October 2021, the Union",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 15,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P015_C01",
      "text": "Government had not filed the affidavit. The ASG, Mr KM Nataraj informed this Court",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 16,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P016_C01",
      "text": "that an affidavit will be filed within two days. By an order dated 21 October 2021, this",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 17,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P017_C01",
      "text": "Court then formulated issues requiring the Union Government to disclose the rationale",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 18,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P018_C01",
      "text": "for the adoption of the criteria used to identify the EWS. On 25 October 2021, the Union",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 19,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P019_C01",
      "text": "Government of its own accord deferred the counselling due to the pendency of the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 20,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P020_C01",
      "text": "petitions. Thereafter, the Union Government filed an affidavit justifying the EWS criteria",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 21,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P021_C01",
      "text": "on 26 October 2021 stating that the criteria was adopted after due deliberation within",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 22,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P022_C01",
      "text": "the Ministry of Social Justice and Empowerment and all the concerned stakeholders.",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 23,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P023_C01",
      "text": "3 When the matter was listed for hearing on 28 October 2021, the Solicitor General",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 24,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P024_C01",
      "text": "sought an adjournment and requested that the petitions be heard after Diwali. On 25",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 25,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P025_C01",
      "text": "Government has taken a considered decision to revisit the criteria for determining the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 26,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P026_C01",
      "text": "review the criteria for identifying EWS. The Committee submitted its report on 31",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 27,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P027_C01",
      "text": "December 2021. Thereafter, the Union Government filed an affidavit before this Court",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 28,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P028_C01",
      "text": "accepting the recommendations of the Committee including the recommendation that",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 29,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P029_C01",
      "text": "the existing criteria for identifying EWS be retained for the present admission year",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 30,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P030_C01",
      "text": "4 The petitions were taken up for urgent hearing by this Court on 5 January 2022",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 31,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P031_C01",
      "text": "after a request was made by the Solicitor General. It was submitted on behalf of the",
      "paragraph_type": "arguments",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 32,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P032_C01",
      "text": "Union Government that the OBC and EWS reservation (with the old criteria according to",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 33,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P033_C01",
      "text": "Subodh Patil and Mr Varun Thakur for the doctors and intervenors challenging the",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 34,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P034_C01",
      "text": "validity of the reservations for OBC and EWS categories. On the other side, we heard",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 35,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P035_C01",
      "text": "Mr Tushar Mehta, Solicitor General, Mr. Nataraj, Additional Solicitor General, Mr P",
      "paragraph_type": "unknown",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
