      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P037_C01",
      "text": "days necessitate a detailed interim order on the applicability of the EWS criteria as",
      "paragraph_type": "order",
      "sections_cited": [],
