      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P038_C01",
      "text": "notified by OM 2019 for NEET-PG 2021. The formulation of the reasons in the interim",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 39,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P039_C01",
      "text": "reservation in the AIQ seats in NEET-PG and NEET-UG is upheld for reasons to follow.",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 40,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P040_C01",
      "text": "In the meantime, there is an urgent need to commence the process of Counselling. We",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 41,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P041_C01",
      "text": "in order to ensure that the admission process is not dislocated;\n(ii) Counselling on the basis of NEET-PG 2021 and NEET- UG 2021 shall",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
