      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P042_C01",
      "text": "seats;\n(iii) The criteria for the determination of the EWS notified by OM 2019 shall",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": 43,
      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P043_C01",
      "text": "for the NEET-PG 2021 and NEET-UG 2021examinations;\n(iv) The validity of the criteria determined by the Pandey Committee for",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
      "cited_cases": [],
      "chunk_number": 1
    },
    {
