      "chunk_id": "SC_2022_NEIL_AURELIO_NUNES_VS_UNION_OF_INDIA_P044_C01",
      "text": "final result of the petitions; and\n(v) The petitions shall be listed for final hearing on the validity of the EWS",
      "paragraph_type": "reasoning",
      "sections_cited": [],
